      "source_id": "source_007",
      "title": "Benchmark design",
      "content_hash": "03e9443028f0065ae41218c422efdcebe73225465468098c9ba49f03596be4d0",
      "claim": "A useful routing benchmark needs fixed task DAGs, multiple candidate models, per-node and per-task scoring, cost accounting, and critical-path latency."
